GTFO and its game data belong to their owners; no file taken from the game is included in this package.
Bundled library (NVorbis.dll), MIT:
- NVorbis 0.10.5, Copyright (c) 2020 Andrew Ward, https://github.com/NVorbis/NVorbis, used unmodified as the Ogg Vorbis decoder.
  Its licence text is shipped in this package as NVorbis.LICENSE.forge.

Everything else in the zip is written for this project. No sound recording is included; audio comes from the mods that use ForgeAudio.
The package is compiled against BepInEx, HarmonyX, Il2CppInterop and the game's interop assemblies, which are installed separately and not included here.